    <p>Forex trading can be gratifying and profitable, but potential risks must always be considered. When you join Orion Capital, you will enjoy the most comprehensive trading experience for all levels of traders, from beginners to seasoned professionals:</p>
    <img src="/images/markets/forex/why.webp" alt="Orion Capital trading platform on a laptop and phone" loading="lazy" class="g-img !max-w-[679px]" />
    <GuideList items={[
      { title: 'Trader Education', html: 'Orion Capital clients gain free access to the NC Academy, packed with articles, video tutorials, e-books, regular webinars, market analysis, and insights from industry experts.' },
      { title: 'User-Friendly Trading Platforms', html: 'Choose from a selection of intuitive and feature-packed <a href="/trading-platforms">trading platforms</a> that can also be accessed on mobile devices.' },
      { title: 'Award-Winning Support', html: 'Our multilingual support professionals can be contacted via Live Chat, email, or phone. Human help is always just a tap or a click away.' },
      { title: 'Security and Regulation', html: 'Orion Capital is dedicated to the highest levels of security and regulation. We are licensed and regulated by multiple international financial authorities.' },
      { title: 'Innovative Trading Tools', html: 'With Orion Capital, you will gain access to the latest technology and tools, such as advanced charting, social trading, and algorithmic trading.' },
      { title: 'Competitive Pricing and Transparent Fees', html: 'Our highly competitive spreads and transparent fee structures keep your trading costs down for better ROI.' },
      { title: 'Risk Management Tools', html: 'We are here to help you reduce your risks with our risk management tools, such as stop loss orders, negative balance protection, margin alerts, and our proprietary Trade Protection risk management tool.' },
    ]} />
    <p>Are you ready to try forex trading without risking any money? Open a demo account now, it’s free!</p>
    <GuideBits kind="cta" />
  </GuideSection>
</GuideLayout>
